  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCDialogue
  dialogueList:
  - Oh? You are a curious stranger, then. Persistent.
  - I imagine then that you have a better understanding of why I stay, then?
  - Perhaps it is not right for us to stay here.
  - But stranger, there is nothing for me past this land. Move on? Onto what?
  - I have no interest in nothingness, and I do not believe there to be anything
    else for me after this.
  - Let me close my eyes and rest here.
